== Trivia ==
* Flat Stone is based on [https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=924939304 this Steam Workshop item] by Maddogs and Joe, originally known as Hydrophobicity.
* It seems as though originally, the lasers produced by the Technology items ({{I|Technology}}, {{I|Technology 2}}, and {{I|Tech.5}}) and {{I|Brimstone}} were meant to synergize, as seen in the [[:file:Collectible Flat Stone concept.png|concept art]] of Flat Stone.

